c","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"承知しました！とりあえず，ヘルプを更新したものをeskkに投げることにします．","ts":"1635203550.231600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gVjg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6f5d0bb-f8e5-49bb-aa91-7b6954a01506","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"今更対応予定はありませんので、skkeletonを使う方がよいかと思います","ts":"1635203486.230800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T+W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dbec7ed-a2cb-482c-bf79-47dae48c8a8f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"被り力","ts":"1635203470.230300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EDP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd948fb9-fd24-422a-a8ab-762609ff6ec0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"それはeskkがネイティヴ補完にしか対応してないからです","ts":"1635203463.229900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SQr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d49838e7-7552-42a0-b9a5-6288744a9d1e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"eskk.vimにはネイティブの補完を前提とした部分があるので書き換えてやる必要がありますね","ts":"1635203461.229800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mCX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6db29e1a-5c59-49e5-ad78-6b0648595183","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"pumというよりeskkの問題なのかなぁと思うのですが，皆様のご意見を伺いたいです","ts":"1635203442.228900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PGIK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72d41fa6-4808-49fc-b26a-bfdaa2df787d","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"ddcで`pum.vim` を有効にしていると `eskk` で入力中は補完候補が選択できなくなりますね．vimネイティブの補完を使っているときは問題ないのですが．\n```call plug#begin(stdpath('data') .. '/site/plugged')\nPlug 'vim-denops/denops.vim'\nPlug 'vim-skk/eskk.vim'\nPlug 'Shougo/pum.vim'\nPlug 'Shougo/ddc.vim'\ncall plug#end()\n\nimap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt;   pum#visible() ? pum#map#insert_relative(+1) : '\u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt;'\nimap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;S-Tab\u0026gt; pum#visible() ? pum#map#insert_relative(-1) : '\u0026lt;S-Tab\u0026gt;'\nimap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-n\u0026gt;   pum#visible() ? pum#map#insert_relative(+1) : '\u0026lt;C-n\u0026gt;'\nimap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-p\u0026gt;   pum#visible() ? pum#map#insert_relative(-1) : '\u0026lt;C-p\u0026gt;'\nimap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-y\u0026gt;   pum#visible() ? pum#map#confirm() : '\u0026lt;C-y\u0026gt;'\nimap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-e\u0026gt;   pum#visible() ? pum#map#cancel() : '\u0026lt;C-e\u0026gt;'\n\ncall ddc#custom#patch_global('completionMenu', 'pum.vim')\ncall ddc#custom#patch_global('sources', ['eskk'])\ncall ddc#enable()```","ts":"1635203381.228000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/9aH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2905304-53e4-4d41-9d09-66e41f1a4cef","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"私は色弱ですが、赤を濃ゆく、緑を薄くするとわかりやすいです。","ts":"1635246800.240400","thread_ts":"1635246284.237300","parent_user_id":"UD1FQV38V","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kkqqX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8D319606-3832-45F3-92D9-67A3B4A9941B","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"赤を濃ゆく、緑を薄くは白地の話なので\n黒地の場合は赤を少し薄く(紫/茶色との区別がつきにくくなる)\n緑を濃ゆく\n\nにしたらいいと思います。\n赤緑色盲には、青黄で表現すればとてもわかりやすいです(三型色覚の人にはわかりづらくなるのだけど)","ts":"1635248161.250600","thread_ts":"1635246284.237300","edited":{"user":"U02GD5GRJ72","ts":"1635248181.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UD1FQV38V","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]},{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Dztw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FC0A32A8-AD4B-407D-880B-13A0E13626C3","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"ぷよぷよがまともにできなかった子供時代……(紫と青)","ts":"1635248233.251900","thread_ts":"1635246284.237300","edited":{"user":"U02GD5GRJ72","ts":"1635248247.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UD1FQV38V","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":3,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U01BY3SDBRS","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lqr"}]}]
